// name :
"P96134442" "The Strong Survive"
// // requiresfailedtext :
"P0" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - TheStrongSurviveSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P598169536" "Reese's Shocked Look"
// tDetailString :
"P1086089531" "Sometimes when you're not too busy, you remember the shocked look on Reese's face when you knocked him out in your one on one fight. It reminds you of an experience you call...<br><br><b><color gold>The Strong Survive</color></b><br><br>After surviving the Powers Division induction ceremony, Reese was eager to go with you on a mission to capture Jack Hammer and the leader of the Destroyers. However, when you arrived to the warehouse, you were ambushed by Reese and his hired help. You easily defeated Reese and found out that he intended on blowing <i>you</i> up after you were defeated. You were then left with a choice - blow Reese up instead, or call in Praetor White to show him just exactly how pathetic Reese was."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marauder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IntroFinished Text :
"P3851646038" "You got your pass, {HeroName}. I'll deal with Reese and his dogs myself."
// Answer Text :
"P591590492" "Very well."
// Page IntroBegin Text :
"P2605450109" "Alright {HeroName}. I'm here.<br><br>So Reese and his dogs tried killin' you off huh? Sayin' they're gonna pin you as some sorta Resistance scum?"
// Answer Text :
"P2755490717" "That's right. And it didn't end well for them."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1975967325" "<color orange>Praetor White barks out a laugh.</color><br><br>Yeah, that much I can tell. So looks like you think you're on the top of the pile now, huh?<br><br>That what you called me here to show off, that you're equal to Reese and his gang?"
// Answer Text :
"P4190600645" "No. That I'm better than Reese and his 'gang'."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3560803372" "Hah!<br><br>I knew you had fire in you, {HeroName}. Maybe you are better, I'll give you that.<br><br>Reese was supposed to be one of the best I had. Looks like I gotta start raisin' my standards then.<br><br>Looks like I gotta be spreadin' the word that there's a new big bad in town - you, {HeroName}. I gotta admit, I didn't think you had it in ya when we first met, but you went and proved me wrong.<br><br>This don't mean you can go and get cocky. You're raisin' the bar, other members of the Powers Division are gonna be goin' after you, lookin' to claim your spot, just like you did with Reese.<br><br>And me? I'm gonna let 'em, 'cause I want the best. You got that clear?"
// Answer Text :
"P1716960209" "Crystal. No one is taking me down."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P4225698533" "Good. Now get outta here.<br><br>I'm gonna make sure Reese learns a <i>very valuable</i> lesson from all this.<br><br>Maybe he'll make it outta here alive - if he's still got the will."
// Answer Text :
"P944845306" "Have fun with Reese."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2344746966" "Here's the situation, {HeroName}.<br><br>We've discovered the location of the Resistance head in Nova. His name is <color yellow>Jack Hammer</color>, and he's real nasty bit of work. Addicted to Fixadine, the works.<br><br>We've got his location in a warehouse in Nova - drugged-out fool was using the place to hide his entire stash of Fixadine. Can you believe it? Here's the <i>best</i> part. We got one of the leaders of the Destroyers in that warehouse too! They're making some sort of deal, the Destroyers and the Resistance both trying to work together.<br><br>Good thing for us is that the PPD doesn't know about this yet. So it's up to you and me to get in there and get ourselves these two. We pull this off, it's power and glory for us!<br><br><color yellow>This arc is a SINGLE PLAYER MORAL CHOICE story arc. You will not be able to have other people on your team assist you with this story arc.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3134910011" "For us, huh? We'll see."
// SendOffString :
"P1652649726" "I'll head out now. We'll pincer them in the warehouse. I'll take the back, you take the front. We'll make sure neither of them can get away from us, not when we're this close to getting our names known throughout all of Praetoria!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1019949206" "Capture Jack Hammer and the Destroyer Leader (Single Player)"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1494545259" "<color orange>Reese has already left to deal with Jack Hammer.</color>"
// TaskTitle :
"P3455604158" "<color deepskyblue>The Strong Survive</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2187068489" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: The Strongest of Them All</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P7418514" "Jack Hammer and the leader of the Destroyers are in here somewhere. Time to get yourself some real power and glory!"

