"P3814462553" "C-come on! Praetor White, it doesn't have to be like this!"
// SaysList :
"P871296557" "<shout>NOTHING can stop me, {HeroName}!"
// SaysList :
"P2276837857" "I have NOT come this far just to die like this!"
// SaysList :
"P1777466936" "A-agh...not like this..."
// SaysList :
"P1184370123" "I'll...come back...{HeroName}...I'll find a way...to hunt you down..."
// SaysList :
"P3658168102" "You'll...never be able to...rest...I won't...forget...this..."
// SaysList :
"P3369027945" "Aaaaagh!!"

